    <item>
      <title>Free Range Wins Silver for Ecological Footprint Calculator at 2025 Anthem Awards</title>
      <link>https://freerange.com/blog/free-range-wins-silver-for-ecological-footprint-calculator-at-2025-anthem-awards</link>
      <description>&lt;div class="hs-featured-image-wrapper"&gt; 
 &lt;a href="https://freerange.com/blog/free-range-wins-silver-for-ecological-footprint-calculator-at-2025-anthem-awards" title="" class="hs-featured-image-link"&gt; &lt;img src="https://freerange.com/hubfs/Anthem-5th-Winner-wewon_silver_4x5-2.png" alt="Free Range Wins Silver for Ecological Footprint Calculator at 2025 Anthem Awards" class="hs-featured-image" style="width:auto !important; max-width:50%; float:left; margin:0 15px 15px 0;"&gt; &lt;/a&gt; 
&lt;/div&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;We’re proud to share that we’ve been honored with a &lt;a href="https://www.anthemawards.com/winners/list/entry/#!sustainability-environment-climate/global-awareness-campaign/ecological-footprint-calculator/1985/-1/619155"&gt;Silver Anthem Award in the Sustainability, Environment &amp;amp; Climate category&lt;/a&gt; for our work on the &lt;a href="https://www.footprintcalculator.org/home/en"&gt;Ecological Footprint Calculator&lt;/a&gt;, a global awareness campaign designed to help individuals and organizations understand and reduce their environmental impact.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Anthem Awards celebrate purpose and mission-driven work that sparks real change. Winning this recognition highlights our ongoing commitment to storytelling and strategy that inspire global sustainability action.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Created in collaboration with the Global Footprint Network, the Ecological Footprint Calculator translates complex data into an intuitive digital experience, empowering millions of users worldwide to explore how their daily choices shape the planet’s future. This tool helps close the gap between awareness and measurable impact.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This achievement reflects the talent, creativity, and heart of our entire team, designers, strategists, developers, and partners, who came together with a shared mission: to make sustainability tangible, personal, and engaging.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We’re grateful to the Anthem Awards for recognizing this work, and to everyone pushing innovation forward in climate and sustainability.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <content:encoded>&lt;div class="hs-featured-image-wrapper"&gt; 
 &lt;a href="https://freerange.com/blog/free-range-wins-silver-for-ecological-footprint-calculator-at-2025-anthem-awards" title="" class="hs-featured-image-link"&gt; &lt;img src="https://freerange.com/hubfs/Anthem-5th-Winner-wewon_silver_4x5-2.png" alt="Free Range Wins Silver for Ecological Footprint Calculator at 2025 Anthem Awards" class="hs-featured-image" style="width:auto !important; max-width:50%; float:left; margin:0 15px 15px 0;"&gt; &lt;/a&gt; 
&lt;/div&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;We’re proud to share that we’ve been honored with a &lt;a href="https://www.anthemawards.com/winners/list/entry/#!sustainability-environment-climate/global-awareness-campaign/ecological-footprint-calculator/1985/-1/619155"&gt;Silver Anthem Award in the Sustainability, Environment &amp;amp; Climate category&lt;/a&gt; for our work on the &lt;a href="https://www.footprintcalculator.org/home/en"&gt;Ecological Footprint Calculator&lt;/a&gt;, a global awareness campaign designed to help individuals and organizations understand and reduce their environmental impact.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Anthem Awards celebrate purpose and mission-driven work that sparks real change. Winning this recognition highlights our ongoing commitment to storytelling and strategy that inspire global sustainability action.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Created in collaboration with the Global Footprint Network, the Ecological Footprint Calculator translates complex data into an intuitive digital experience, empowering millions of users worldwide to explore how their daily choices shape the planet’s future. This tool helps close the gap between awareness and measurable impact.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This achievement reflects the talent, creativity, and heart of our entire team, designers, strategists, developers, and partners, who came together with a shared mission: to make sustainability tangible, personal, and engaging.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We’re grateful to the Anthem Awards for recognizing this work, and to everyone pushing innovation forward in climate and sustainability.&lt;/p&gt;  
&lt;img src="https://track.hubspot.com/__ptq.gif?a=2211982&amp;amp;k=14&amp;amp;r=https%3A%2F%2Ffreerange.com%2Fblog%2Ffree-range-wins-silver-for-ecological-footprint-calculator-at-2025-anthem-awards&amp;amp;bu=https%253A%252F%252Ffreerange.com%252Fblog&amp;amp;bvt=rss" alt="" width="1" height="1" style="min-height:1px!important;width:1px!important;border-width:0!important;margin-top:0!important;margin-bottom:0!important;margin-right:0!important;margin-left:0!important;padding-top:0!important;padding-bottom:0!important;padding-right:0!important;padding-left:0!important; "&gt;</content:encoded>
